{"name": "Don't Split: The Party", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/ad0db41f58b0f028a6241575f15c3ea4.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"478\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/18cba5208b3ce6a9e07c90630c2fbb31.poster.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/18cba5208b3ce6a9e07c90630c2fbb31.webm?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/18cba5208b3ce6a9e07c90630c2fbb31.mp4?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\"The world's most unlikely heroes now wield the most dangerous power imaginable. What could go wrong?\"</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/77ed888a826c65419fb5611c328d5961.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place adventures on the world map, then send your heroes to venture into them. Abandoned villages, cursed crypts, vampire mansions, and strange places where the spirit of adventure still lingers.<br/>But be careful - you are the one creating the world, your party must survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/1326afe365cb38851f8c685483d9a24a.poster.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/1326afe365cb38851f8c685483d9a24a.webm?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/1326afe365cb38851f8c685483d9a24a.mp4?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/7e2ecd8fe86d9f64d76874d84d267619.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place adventures close together - and they begin to <strong>influence</strong> each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Vampire Mansion can turn nearby villages into a source of blood\u2026 and if enough is gathered, the Countess herself will awaken. The Black Crypt feeds on the souls of the fallen nearby. The Cursed Knights of the Tower trade the heads of slain enemies for gold.  The more dangerous your combinations become, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/7db0aa13d31a00994d3770ed9a7a8a04.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day brings new decisions. Travel, fight, rest by the fire, or speak with the characters you meet along the way. Movement points are limited, so every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/6fbbcdbcd8a9e1a73c957fc0d9c9ac74.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position your heroes before battle and study your enemies\u2019 abilities. Then watch your strategy unfold in fast real-time autobattles. You create the dangers - but can your heroes survive them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/ee7d5efcf6ef69813b57b02c51fc8407.poster.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/ee7d5efcf6ef69813b57b02c51fc8407.webm?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/ee7d5efcf6ef69813b57b02c51fc8407.mp4?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/3ca66dc3817bcda5eff202a5b020e806.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful talents, discover magical items, and upgrade your gear. Experiment with builds - an artefact found in one run may inspire an entirely new playstyle in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"110\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/f56b34da496cce07a94a69a9c5d89c46.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1219\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests, meet strange characters, and uncover their stories in a world where adventure has long faded. Heroes have become a forgotten profession, but your actions may change that. Every run awakens new encounters, new quests, and new consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"730\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/c8b0ee78ecbba94db07c0f8c27b1ab12.poster.avif?t=1774458845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/c8b0ee78ecbba94db07c0f8c27b1ab12.webm?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/extras/c8b0ee78ecbba94db07c0f8c27b1ab12.mp4?t=1774458845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The Dungeon Master is dead - and his power is now yours. A roguelike RPG where you create deadly encounters and send your heroes to survive them. Win tactical autobattles, strengthen your party, and restore adventure to a dying world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187180/b8c95c0649deb100ec9ecbbb89657e251ee1499e/header.jpg?t=1774458845", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Strategy RPG", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelite", "Strategy", "Perma Death"], "developers": "Grimgull Studio", "publishers": "Grimgull Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4187180", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "2 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/995Tx_sRwfc", "first_seen": 1772406000.0, "review_rank": 1075}